Third-party code
----------------

The port discovery behind "Ports agents opened" (server/proc-ports.ts) is adapted from
server/scan.ts of the port-forward plugin in alessandrocornacchia/paseo-port-forward
(https://github.com/alessandrocornacchia/paseo-port-forward): decoding /proc/net/tcp and
/proc/net/tcp6 addresses, finding a socket's process through the socket inode links in
/proc/<pid>/fd, and walking parent chains. That code is used under the following license:

